The trick used is to engrave with your finger first, and then with the 
wand. The messages you get can identify a lot of the different wands. 
What you engrave doesn't really matter; Elbereth scares monsters, which 
can be nice (especially if the wand turns out to be fire, which makes 
the engraving last), and it also exercizes wisdom I think. People who 
want to stay illiterate just engrave 'x' or 'X'.

